2a1678c1\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t81-7n2jb4f5/candidate/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-bb43wxml/c-a2otft4u/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' 'fa4adc81-cbaf-4303-a85f-20abbab9e3ab' '--session' '4438f532-8972-48fd-8b3b-96062a1678c1' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T19:56:07.327Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"fa4adc81-cbaf-4303-a85f-20abbab9e3ab","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"fa4adc81-cbaf-4303-a85f-20abbab9e3ab","session_id":"4438f532-8972-48fd-8b3b-96062a1678c1","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"510955a9-4d39-4ca4-b9b3-61a1833725a0","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"5b306578-daef-4969-8de0-60d6e34e3933","thread":"510955a9-4d39-4ca4-b9b3-61a1833725a0","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-5b306578-daef-4969-8de0-60d6e34e3933"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-bb43wxml/c-a2otft4u/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"70fdd9828f27c26cea9d9222be8a63983544b631","card_snapshot_id":"7e60656c-9cc1-4161-99a9-90d353b7432a","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-14T19:56:08.390Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"fa4adc81-cbaf-4303-a85f-20a